Wellbeing & Mental Health
At Abingdon House School, our students’ happiness and wellbeing lies at the heart of everything that we do.
We are dedicated to delivering a whole school approach where positive mental health and wellbeing are fundamental to the values, ethos and culture of the school, empowering students to develop confidence, self belief and resilience through:
Wellbeing focussed enrichment sessions;
Individual and small group mental health support;
Positive behavioural support;
Rewards, celebrations, and awards;
Dedicated calm spaces for wellbeing and regulation;
